KSA PDPL Compliance Gap Assessment
Objectives
By the end of this lab, you will be able to:

Interpret key KSA PDPL articles and map them to organizational controls
Build a scoring spreadsheet to assess compliance maturity using LibreOffice Calc
Identify and prioritize compliance gaps against SDAIA implementing regulations
Produce a structured, board-ready remediation roadmap document
Prerequisites
Basic familiarity with data protection concepts (data subject rights, lawful basis, breach notification)
Comfortable with Linux terminal navigation and text editors
No prior SDAIA/PDPL-specific knowledge required, but review of general privacy law concepts is helpful
Environment Setup
Al Nafi provides a single Linux machine via Start Lab. Run the following to prepare your workspace:

